<title>USA: Paging Network CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Paging Network CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paging Network Inc said Monday its senior vice president and chief financial officer, Kenneth Sanders, is resigning effective August 29 to join a privately held Florida company.</p>
<p>The paging services company, which is also known as PageNet, said it has begun a search to replace Sanders, who joined the company in January 1996.</p>
<p>In the meantime, G. Robert Thompson, vice president of finance since 1991, will serve as acting CFO, it said.</p>
</text>
